#. js-lingui-id: ZabLEt
msgid "W3villa Technologies set out to solve it properly, not with a workaround, but with a product."
msgstr "W3villa Technologies se propuso resolverlo correctamente, no con un parche, sino con un producto."

#: src/sections/three-cards/three-cards.data.ts
#. js-lingui-id: 3v2ipf
msgid "W3villa used Twenty as a production-grade framework for the data model, permissions, authentication, and workflow engine they would otherwise have rebuilt themselves."
